Z||000000||new fiero||07-11-2001||09:07 AM||||OK, I was going to put the facia (and all that is under it)from my 88 coupe on my 86 coupe but the metal piece that screws in right under the lights is curved differently than the 86.  So I said fine and put the 86s back on and then tried to put the Facia on and it would not line up with the holes on top where the plastic holders go.  What am I doing wrong??!!  Thanks<P>------------------<BR>newfiero<BR>(swapping 88 L4 to 86 and having fun!)<BR>Yahoo! Messenger id: newfiero||||reg||5
